<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">CAMPUS TABLE / TEAM 09</view><view class="title">每一餐 都值得期待</view><view class="subtitle">吃点喜欢的，今天也要好好吃饭。</view><view class="hero"><view class="hero-art">🍛</view><view class="hero-title">今天吃什么<view></view>让转盘帮你决定</view><view class="muted">先选条件，再转出今天的一餐</view><button class="primary" bindtap="wheel">{{showWheel?'收起转盘':'帮我选一餐 ↗'}}</button></view>
<view class="panel"><input placeholder="搜索想吃的菜品" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="input"/><view class="chips"><picker range="{{canteens}}" value="{{canteenIndex}}" data-field="canteenIndex" bindchange="filter">{{canteens[canteenIndex]}}</picker><picker range="{{sorts}}" value="{{sortIndex}}" data-field="sortIndex" bindchange="filter">{{sorts[sortIndex]}}</picker><picker range="{{prices}}" value="{{priceIndex}}" data-field="priceIndex" bindchange="filter">{{prices[priceIndex]}}</picker><picker range="{{tastes}}" value="{{tasteIndex}}" data-field="tasteIndex" bindchange="filter">{{tastes[tasteIndex]}}</picker><picker range="{{diets}}" value="{{dietIndex}}" data-field="dietIndex" bindchange="filter">{{diets[dietIndex]}}</picker><picker range="{{spices}}" value="{{spiceIndex}}" data-field="spiceIndex" bindchange="filter">{{spices[spiceIndex]}}</picker><picker range="{{crowdOptions}}" value="{{crowdIndex}}" data-field="crowdIndex" bindchange="filter">{{crowdOptions[crowdIndex]}}</picker></view><view class="row budget-range"><input type="digit" placeholder="最低价 元" value="{{minPrice}}" data-field="minPrice" bindblur="budget"/><text>—</text><input type="digit" placeholder="最高价 元" value="{{maxPrice}}" data-field="maxPrice" bindblur="budget"/></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{filterError}}">{{filterError}}</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{crowdIndex}}">只展示窗口近15分钟有上报且符合条件的菜品。</view><view class="row mt"><button class="small" bindtap="preferences">{{usePreferences?'✓ 已应用口味画像':'应用口味画像'}}</button><button class="small" bindtap="clear">清空筛选</button></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{showWheel}}" class="panel center"><view class="section-title">本轮 {{wheelItems.length}} 道候选</view><view class="notice">共匹配{{items.length}}道，每轮最多抽取8道；结果对应指针所指菜名。</view><view class="wheel-pointer">▼</view><view class="wheel food-wheel" style="transform:rotate({{rot}}deg);background:{{wheelBackground}}"><text wx:for="{{wheelItems}}" wx:key="id" class="wheel-label" style="{{item.labelStyle}}">{{item.name}}</text><view class="wheel-center">食</view></view><view class="wrap"><button class="primary" bindtap="spin" disabled="{{spinning||!wheelItems.length}}">{{spinning?'正在寻找美味…':'转一转 今天吃它'}}</button><button class="small" bindtap="shuffle" disabled="{{spinning}}">换一批候选</button></view><view wx:if="{{!wheelItems.length}}" class="notice">没有符合条件的菜品，请放宽筛选。</view><view wx:if="{{result}}" class="mt"><view class="big-emoji">{{result.emoji}}</view><view class="section-title">{{result.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{result.canteenName}} · {{result.windowName}}</view><view class="notice">{{result.reasons}}</view><button class="primary mt" bindtap="result">就它了 查看详情</button><button class="small mt" bindtap="planResult">安排到就餐日历</button></view></view>
<view class="section-title">食堂好味 · {{items.length}} 道可选</view><dish-list items="{{items}}" bind:changed="update"/><view class="notice">餐厅名称按需求配置；窗口、菜品和价格为示例。食材过敏请向窗口确认。</view><view class="wrap mt"><button class="primary" bindtap="openPlan">🗓 就餐计划与周预算</button><button class="small" bindtap="openCompare">⇄ 菜品对比</button></view><view class="owner">模块负责人 · 杨铭宇</view></view>
